{"id":"en_troublemaker-parents-vs-the-in-laws","title":"Troublemaker Parents vs. The In-Laws","titleEn":"Troublemaker Parents vs. The In-Laws","description":"While shopping at a mall, Zhuang Yao runs into a misbehaving child and a parent who is even worse. The child, Shen Laotai's granddaughter, grabs at Zhuang Yao's ice cream and is refused, after which shop owner Shen Ling and the grandmother scheme to extort her. Shen Ling claims Zhuang Yao damaged store merchandise and demands payment, then turns violent and asks for one million in compensation.\n\nShen Ling wrongly assumes Zhuang Yao is Lu Nan's mistress, a misunderstanding she fuels herself. In truth, Zhuang Yao is Lu Nan's stepmother, and Lu Nan, too ashamed to set the record straight, lets the lie stand. When Lu's father appears, Shen Ling grasps that she has insulted Lu Nan's future mother-in-law. Zhuang Yao then uses her standing to expose Shen Ling's misconduct, prompting Lu's father t","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/troublemaker-parents-vs-the-in-laws/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/troublemaker-parents-vs-the-in-laws/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Avenge","Karma","Love","Secret","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbzce/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_troublemaker-parents-vs-the-in-laws_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbzce/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_troublemaker-parents-vs-the-in-laws_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbzce/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_troublemaker-parents-vs-the-in-laws_3","title":"Episode 3","